---
source: crates/runtime/tests/models/search.rs
description: "SELECT id, answer, trunc(_score, 2) FROM vector_search(qs, 'second', answer) order by _score desc, id LIMIT 4"
---
|               |           ProjectionExec: expr=[_score@2 as _score, answer@3 as answer, id@0 as id]                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |             HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Left, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(id@0, id@1), (question@1, question@2)], projection=[id@0, question@1, _score@2, answer@3]                                       |
|               |               CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                 ProjectionExec: expr=[union_extract(json_get(key@0, id), int) as id, union_extract(json_get(key@0, question), str) as question, 1 - distance@1 as _score]                                                           |
|               |                   BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                     RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                       S3VectorsQueryExec (INDEX_NAME_1): limit=100                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |               SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                 BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                   DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[1]                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
